    # `--insert-columns-sample` and `--delete-columns-sample` and "P2 and P3",
    # with "Planning rulings during P2", "Planning verification and rulings on
    # P2" and "Planning rulings during P3"):
    #   1. the release binaries built at the phase commit on both targets and
    #      hashed;
    #   2. for each of the two column samples, the corpus run on both targets
    #      into its own run directory, runs/<date>-<sha>-insert and -delete,
    #      recorded as m2p3-p3-insert-<utc-date>-<shortsha> and
    #      m2p3-p3-delete-..., each record checked against its run directory
